{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly","id":987958,"title":"Prometheans are what exactly?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Promethean: The Created"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-15T15:22:29-07:00","id":987958,"title":"Prometheans are what exactly?","content":"Retracted Statement","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11693,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/","user":"Guest","date":". 02-13-2019, 08:41 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-15T15:33:51-07:00","id":987964,"title":"","content":"Prometheans are human corpses given new life through various rituals (or sometimes, just random chance and obsession) that imbue them with the Divine Fire, a strange force of change and chaos that drives them on a metaphysical journey towards becoming a real human being. While a Frankenstein is sewh together out of disparate parts and charged with electricity and an Osiran begins their Pilgrimage submerged and missing a piece, they're all fundamentally the same thing: a new creature trying to become a new proper soul. Lineages are just a rough guideline for fairly dependable ways to create a Promethean that inform some tendencies and abilities, but all Created would recognize each other as kin.<br /> <br /> It's a game about learning what humanity is about and building an identity you can become in a world that you don't understand full of people who reject you. I love it dearly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-15T15:44:23-07:00","id":987968,"title":"","content":"Prometheans are beings created from something that does not live, like dead bodies, clay or machines. This is done with a ritual that instills them with the Divine Fire, giving them life without turning them human. This is what unifies the Prometheans and gives them access to roughly the same kind of powers. There is no single &quot;true&quot; way to do this: there are countless variations of the ritual possible. A Lineage is essentially a group (or rather: line) of Prometheans created in roughly the same way. The first Promethean created in a particular way is called the Progenitor, with the five &quot;core&quot; Lineages (the ones from 1e, and the first five mentioned in the 2e book) being named after their Progenitors. Frankensteins are made from stitched-together corpses and struck with lightning, Osirians are reassembled and embalmed but are missing something (either through requirement for the ritual or because of an effect of the ritual), Tammuz are created from earth and instilled with holy words like golems, the Unfleshed are essentially robots, automatons and other man-made things, Extempores are... well, nobody really knows.<br /> <br /> Something similar to this we see in Mage: The Ascension: even if all the Mages work their miracles in different ways the fundamental concepts are the same, no matter if you use a deck of Tarot cards, Voudou, a laptop, a raygun or a bowl full of herbs burning over a fire.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12085-beriorn","name":"Beriorn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12085_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-15T15:55:31-07:00","id":987976,"title":"","content":"The elevator pitch is that Prometheans are a catch-all for life miraculously but unwisely created from nothing, burdened with their ignorance of the world and beset by prejudice and exploitation, carrying on through the world in a search for peace and a place of their own.<br /> <br /> There are elements common to all Prometheans derived from Frankenstein: the dangerous naivet\u00e9 of the Created, invigoration through electricity, the Disquiet that provokes torch-carrying mobs at its worst, and how fire bad. There are also elements derived from particular stories, including Frankenstein, for the different Lineages reflecting different ways the Created come to be: the patchwork body parts of the Frankenstein Lineage, Galateids sometimes hewn from stone, Tammuz golems imbued with life by a blessed word. And there are elements to Promethean as a game that complement the myths of created beings without necessarily deriving from them directly: the lonely journey that evokes the Incredible Hulk TV show credits, the put-upon, soul-searching condition of Alan Moore's Swamp Thing, the innocent hope of Homeward Bound.<br /> <br /> What brings it all together isn't the aesthetics of each legend or creature \u2013 the Extempore even provide official support for Prometheans with no Lineage and no recognizable mythic origin. It's the experience of being an outsider with no past, no family, no familiarity, and nowhere to call home, but pressing on in the hope that, eventually, you can forge all those things. In the meanwhile: misunderstandings, confusion, grief, and violence. That's the common thread to Prometheans.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-15T16:00:33-07:00","id":987978,"title":"","content":"Prometheans are an original concept that draws inspiration from many sources, including but not limited to Frankenstein's monster. They are artificial life forms, Created beings brought to a facsimile of life by Divine Fire, like Prometheus was said to have stolen from the gods and given to humanity. This animating force burns away at their beings, causing them Torment; their very existence is pain to them. It leaks out from them, burning everyone and everything around them; people, animals, and the land itself rejects them for reasons neither party fully understands. When enough of it leaks out into an area it scorches the earth in a Firestorm, a flurry of raw dynamic force that brings natural disasters, rioting, and other catastrophes. Prometheans seek to escape this wretched existence by embracing the transformative force that gives them life and using it to change themselves into true living beings - humans, specifically.<br /> <br /> Lineages are just that; lines of descent from one Promethean to the next. When a human creates a Promethean, as Doctor Frankenstein did, they play the surrogate Prometheus, stealing Divine Fire (perhaps unknowingly) from a mysterious force known simply as The Principle, and imbuing their creation with it to give it life, or something that passes for life. Afterwords, the Creations sometimes mimic their progenitors and create companions for themselves by the same methods. This is done for a variety of reasons, from loneliness, to love, to something resembling paternal urges. Some Prometheans even believe that propogatong their Lineage is a necessary step in the Great Work of becoming human. Frankenstein was not the first human to create life where there had been none - Isis assembled the pieces of her husband, Osiris's body, sewed them together, and wrapped them in linnen before raising him from death. Pygmalion of Cypress carved himself a lover from Ivory, named her Galatea, and prayed to Aphrodite to bring her to life. These are all real-world myths of Created beings, and in the Chronicles of Darkness, those myths contain a seed of truth, though the reality was usually more grim than the myth - Galatea, for example, was most likely carved from flesh, not from Ivory. Either way, the methods of their Creation survive in the minds of the Created, who continue their lines even into the modern day.<br /> <br /> The Lineages in the books are not the <i>only</i> ways to give artificial life to a human effigy, but they are the ones that have been most widely and consistently propogated. But who knows, maybe there's a little Created boy out there somewhere, made by a lonely toymaker who wanted a son. Maybe he's made other puppets to share in his journey to become a real boy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":269,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","user":"Charlaquin","date":". 10-15-2016, 07:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-15T18:32:50-07:00","id":988043,"title":"","content":"Retracted Statement","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11693,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/","user":"Guest","date":". 02-13-2019, 08:41 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-15T19:54:48-07:00","id":988072,"title":"","content":"Damn. You guys really make me want to play this game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8492-dxanders","name":"dxanders","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"378"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-15T21:28:46-07:00","id":988116,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>dxanders</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988072#post988072\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Damn. You guys really make me want to play this game.</div> </div> </div> </div>It gets my vote for best game in the CofD, tied with Changeling. While I might like some better, it's still pretty damn close to a masterpiece.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T04:11:18-07:00","id":988203,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>dxanders</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988072#post988072\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Damn. You guys really make me want to play this game.</div> </div> </div> </div>Do note that due to the personal nature of the Pilgrimage Promethean is best enjoyed in a small group with an experienced ST.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12085-beriorn","name":"Beriorn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12085_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T06:00:59-07:00","id":988218,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Beriorn</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988203#post988203\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do note that due to the personal nature of the Pilgrimage Promethean is best enjoyed in a small group with an experienced ST.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, no doubt. It definitely seems like a challenging game to run in much the same way as Wraith: The Oblivion was.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8492-dxanders","name":"dxanders","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"378"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T14:14:45-07:00","id":988387,"title":"","content":"Also, you need to tinker with it a bit if you want it to be about any goal other than becoming human, even if you just want that to be a possibility. The book gets super sledgehammery about &quot;The Only Good Goal Is Becoming Human And Anything Else Is Wrong And Bad&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T14:16:46-07:00","id":988388,"title":"","content":"Which isn't really a flaw; it's just the nature of the game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T14:31:11-07:00","id":988402,"title":"","content":"You know, I'd probably love it if Vampire had made the Ordo Dracul the main covenant and had all the others minor factions or antagonists, but I'd be able to understand when people said &quot;but I don't want to play a vampire mad scientist, it's kind of a flaw that the game forces you to&quot;.<br /> <br /> Like, if they ever do a Player's Guide or an ST Guide, and it doesn't even raise the possibility of alternate goals or removing the Pilgrimage, I'm going to hit full Karkat mode.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5358,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","user":"Geckopirateship","date":". 10-16-2016, 05:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T14:39:52-07:00","id":988410,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988387#post988387\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, you need to tinker with it a bit if you want it to be about any goal other than becoming human, even if you just want that to be a possibility.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is true. Although, you can keep an Alembic if you complete all 10 Refinements on your Pilgrimage. Not much of a consolation prize if you have your heart set on becoming something completely non-human. Humanity as a desireable state that you want to strive towards is just part of the buy-in for the game. If you don't buy into that, you will indeed need to hack the game to change that fact.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T14:45:56-07:00","id":988418,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988402#post988402\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You know, I'd probably love it if Vampire had made the Ordo Dracul the main covenant and had all the others minor factions or antagonists, but I'd be able to understand when people said &amp;quot;but I don't want to play a vampire mad scientist, it's kind of a flaw that the game forces you to&amp;quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>No more than it's a flaw that the game &quot;forces you&quot; to play vampires. In this hypothetical Ordo-focused version of Vampire, playing a member of this group would just be part of the buy-in of the game. Play it, hack it, or skip it, but don't assume that because you don't like it it's inherently flawed. Personal tastes are personal.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988387#post988387\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Like, if they ever do a Player's Guide or an ST Guide, and it doesn't even raise the possibility of alternate goals or removing the Pilgrimage, I'm going to hit full Karkat mode.</div> </div> </div> </div>I wouldn't get my expectations up. That would be comparable to a vampire ST guide discussing the possibility of removing feeding.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T14:55:55-07:00","id":988424,"title":"","content":"No, I consider it a genuine flaw if a game railroads you onto one very specific path. To me, the buy-in isn't &quot;becoming human&quot;, it's &quot;playing as an artificially created being&quot;. That's the part that's the core of it. If you think becoming human should be as central to Promethean as feeding is to vampires...<br /> <br /> And vampire actually does have a discipline that lets you feed on breath, and some vampires who are working on a way to not have to feed, so it's more flexible even there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T15:06:00-07:00","id":988431,"title":"","content":"Again though, this isn't a case of the game being flawed; it's a case of the game not catering to your preferences.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T15:08:28-07:00","id":988433,"title":"","content":"There are people who liked the Star Wars prequels. Cryptozoologists have tried for years to find the line between criticism and opinion. Objectivity is a unicorn.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T15:17:25-07:00","id":988438,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988424#post988424\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No, I consider it a genuine flaw if a game railroads you onto one very specific path.</div> </div> </div> </div>There are a lot of paths you can take in Promethean. The do all lead to the same destination, but just because you don't like it doesn't make it bad. Lots of people do like it, and they are not wrong for liking it. Nor are you wrong for disliking it. Again, personal tastes are personal.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988424#post988424\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To me, the buy-in isn't &amp;quot;becoming human&amp;quot;, it's &amp;quot;playing as an artificially created being&amp;quot;. That's the part that's the core of it.</div> </div> </div> </div>You don't get to decide what the buy-in is, that's not how buy-in works.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988424#post988424\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you think becoming human should be as central to Promethean as feeding is to vampires...</div> </div> </div> </div>My opinion on whether becoming human <i>should be</i> so central to Promethean doesn't matter. It just <i>is</i>. That's the way the book is written, and no matter what you, I, or anyone else thinks Promethean <i>should</i> be that won't change it. It is what it is, and if you don't like it you can house rule it or you can not play it.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988424#post988424\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And vampire actually does have a discipline that lets you feed on breath, and some vampires who are working on a way to not have to feed, so it's more flexible even there.</div> </div> </div> </div>There are more paths to becoming human than there are ways to gain Vitae.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T15:21:01-07:00","id":988440,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988433#post988433\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There are people who liked the Star Wars prequels.</div> </div> </div> </div>And they are not wrong for liking them. The prequels are as George Lucas wanted them to be. The fact that I don't like what he wanted them to be doesn't make them any less Star Wars canon.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988424#post988424\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Cryptozoologists have tried for years to find the line between criticism and opinion. Objectivity is a unicorn.</div> </div> </div> </div>Fortunately, the difference between constructive criticism and complaining is well understood.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T15:22:33-07:00","id":988443,"title":"","content":"Again, the fact that there are all of these intricately detailed and diverse paths isn't worth much if they all have the shame forced end goal. I can say that, and I can say that I honestly believe that making that decision was a mistake on the part of the writers, a mistake that they dug their heels in on. Promethean and Beast have a lot in common, it's just that more people objected to Beast: and even their objections didn't lead to the things people objected to being changed in any meaningful way. Like I've said, my expectations have learned not to get off the couch.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T15:30:55-07:00","id":988456,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988443#post988443\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Again, the fact that there are all of these intricately detailed and diverse paths isn't worth much if they all have the shame forced end goal. I can say that, and I can say that I honestly believe that making that decision was a mistake on the part of the writers, a mistake that they dug their heels in on.</div> </div> </div> </div>It was intentional, so by definition not a mistake. Maybe not a choice you would have made in their position. Maybe a choice you think made the game less appealing. But it was not a mistake.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988443#post988443\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Promethean and Beast have a lot in common, it's just that more people objected to Beast: and even their objections didn't lead to the things people objected to being changed in any meaningful way. Like I've said, my expectations have learned not to get off the couch.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ok.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T15:34:36-07:00","id":988458,"title":"","content":"I guess my definition of mistake isn't just &quot;an accident&quot; but &quot;anything that wasn't a good idea&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T15:36:17-07:00","id":988460,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988458#post988458\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I guess my definition of mistake isn't just &amp;quot;an accident&amp;quot; but &amp;quot;anything that wasn't a good idea&amp;quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>And by what metric do you assess the goodness value of an idea?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T15:40:32-07:00","id":988465,"title":"","content":"For a tabletop game: &quot;Does this fit the setting/tone, is it fun to play, does it give the players choice and flexibility?&quot; And yes, &quot;is this something I like&quot;, because, as I've said, there's no such thing as objectivity, and it's impossible to criticize anything other than spelling/grammar/factual consistency without involving opinion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T15:49:41-07:00","id":988474,"title":"","content":"I'm curious about something. Keep in my i've only skimmed the book so far. But how possible is it to play a centimanus? I could see a prometheans character disgusted with humanity and deciding to become a crime boss or hit man or enforcer. Could you still play your character in the transmutation of flux i think its called?? I see it like wanting to play a low humanity vampire. Maybe not part of the majority but definitaly doable.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Completed campaign: Scion 2nd Edition. Les L\u00e9gendes Currently playing: Being a dad for a 3 year old daughter and a 2 years old son and now a beautiful new baby.","edited":{"userid":11312,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11312-maitrecorbo","user":"Maitrecorbo","date":".  Typo 10-16-2016, 06:50 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11312-maitrecorbo","name":"Maitrecorbo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11312_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"719"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T16:00:26-07:00","id":988483,"title":"","content":"It's quite playable. There's a price to going Centimanus (you don't generate Vitriol); but that's to be expected when playing the equivalent of a low-Humanity vampire.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T16:20:18-07:00","id":988496,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988465#post988465\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For a tabletop game: &amp;quot;Does this fit the setting/tone,</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, the Pilgrimage gets a check in that category, considering the whole game is built around it.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988465#post988465\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">is it fun to play,</div> </div> </div> </div>That's another check from me, I would assume not from you.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988465#post988465\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">does it give the players choice and flexibility?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm going to have to challenge you on this metric. The only roleplayinf game with absolute flexibility and unconstrained choice is &quot;let's play pretend&quot;. Which, granted, is a pretty awesome game, but you'd be hard pressed to find adults who agree it is the best RPG ever. Every game mechanic and every setting element constrains choice and flexibility, but that is not an inherently bad thing. Constraints foster creativity, which is why adults tend to prefer RPGs with more constraints than &quot;let's play pretend&quot;, because they generally have a harder time exercising creativity than children do. However, I do agree that a certain amount of choice and flexibility are desireable in RPGs, and to a greater degree than in most other media, even other interactive media. So, I would say that a good RPG element strikes a balance between flexibility and constraint. Where exactly the optimal balance lies will vary from one person to the next. For me, Promethean falls within my tolerable range, and I take it it falls outside of yours. So, again, check from me, no check from you.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988465#post988465\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&amp;quot;And yes, &amp;quot;is this something I like&amp;quot;, because, as I've said, there's no such thing as objectivity, and it's impossible to criticize anything other than spelling/grammar/factual consistency without involving opinion.</div> </div> </div> </div>No arguments there, so again, check from me, no check from you. So all told, we've got a game that hits all the marks for some people, and misses most of them for you. Which is why we talk about these things in terms of personal preference. I do find Promethean fun. I do like it. I do think it strikes a good balance between flexibility and constraint. You don't. Of course, the people making the game know it is impossible to hit all the boxes for everyone. So instead, they make choices and they commit to them, in order to appeal to a certain target audience. The fact that you are not the target audience for Promethean doesn't make it a bad game for those of us who are. It just makes it a game you don't like. And that's ok.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T16:24:33-07:00","id":988498,"title":"","content":"For the first, I meant ChroD as a whole. And yes, as I've said, I know that opinion makes up most of it. I also know that &quot;depth&quot; is subjective: as much as I can argue that it's much less deep than people think it is, and it's fabled emotional resonance is mostly cheap inspirationwank and mortality porn, that's something it's especially hard to be objective about. But that doesn't change the fact that I genuinely think it would be a better game with more flexibility. I don't think that opening up the options- I don't even expect it to be 100% my ideal personal fantasy world, just give me a bone- would make it a genuinely better game. For one thing, you'd still be able to enjoy everything you like about it (unless smug jabs at transhumanism are one of the major draws for you), but I would be able to enjoy it as well. I might not be in the target audience, but I think I should have been. The Creature is my absolute all time favorite classic horror monster. Mad scientists are my second favorite. I absolutely loved Frankenstein; and I love stories about artificial life. By most metrics, I am in the target audience. Promethean should have appealed to me. But when I can check of all of those boxes, yet the game still doesn't appeal to me, I can say something is wrong. I mean, I'll I'm asking for is at least something saying &quot;Prometheans can pursue goals other than becoming human&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T16:35:22-07:00","id":988502,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988498#post988498\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For the first, I meant ChroD as a whole. And yes, as I've said, I know that opinion makes up most of it. I also know that &amp;quot;depth&amp;quot; is subjective: as much as I can argue that it's much less deep than people think it is, and it's fabled emotional resonance is mostly cheap inspirationwank and mortality porn, that's something it's especially hard to be objective about. But that doesn't change the fact that I genuinely think it would be a better game with more flexibility. I don't think that opening up the options- I don't even expect it to be 100% my ideal personal fantasy world, just give me a bone- would make it a genuinely better game. For one thing, you'd still be able to enjoy everything you like about it (unless smug jabs at transhumanism are one of the major draws for you), but I would be able to enjoy it as well. I might not be in the target audience, but I think I should have been. The Creature is my absolute all time favorite classic horror monster. Mad scientists are my second favorite. I absolutely loved Frankenstein; and I love stories about artificial life. By most metrics, I am in the target audience. Promethean should have appealed to me. But when I can check of all of those boxes, yet the game still doesn't appeal to me, I can say something is wrong. I mean, I'll I'm asking for is at least something saying &amp;quot;Prometheans can pursue goals other than becoming human&amp;quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>If the Demon Storyteller's Guide can give us a cyberpunk pocket plane where you play as Stigmatic blade runner cops, then I'd expect a hypothetical Promethean Storyteller's Guide to have alternate New Dawns. That satisfies everybody; Promethean's canonical &quot;integrity&quot; isn't tainted in the eyes of the thematic purists, and everyone looking for alternatives is sated.<br /> <br /> ...fuck, I really want that book now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T16:40:11-07:00","id":988505,"title":"","content":"I want that as much as you do, but keep in mind that second edition seems to firmly strapped a pair of industrial tunnel boring machines to its heels when it comes to the humanity thing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T16:42:48-07:00","id":988507,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988505#post988505\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I want that as much as you do, but keep in mind that second edition seems to firmly strapped a pair of industrial tunnel boring machines to its heels when it comes to the humanity thing.</div> </div> </div> </div>Eh, I see it as more likely than Changeling ever doing a &quot;Faerie was fun and awesome and why would you ever come back&quot; that some folks want.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T16:50:10-07:00","id":988515,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988498#post988498\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For the first, I meant ChroD as a whole. And yes, as I've said, I know that opinion makes up most of it. I also know that &quot;depth&quot; is subjective:</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, we can argue that &quot;humanity is a desirable state&quot; is a thematic element through the entirety of ChroD if you want. But I think you're probably already aware of that fact, and your dislike of it is probably a big part of your growing distaste for the developers. But since that subject seems to being you a great deal of distress, let's maybe not go down that route, hmm?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988498#post988498\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">as much as I can argue that it's much less deep than people think it is, and it's fabled emotional resonance is mostly cheap inspirationwank and mortality porn, that's something it's especially hard to be objective about.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hey, remember rules 1 and 2? I'm not going to give you an infraction for this post because I'm trying to have an earnest conversation with you, but I am going to be flagging it so mods less embroiled in this discussion can assess it.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988498#post988498\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But that doesn't change the fact that I genuinely think it would be a better game with more flexibility.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ok. You can express that without trash talking the game or the people who like it.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988498#post988498\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't think that opening up the options- I don't even expect it to be 100% my ideal personal fantasy world, just give me a bone- would make it a genuinely better game. For one thing, you'd still be able to enjoy everything you like about it (unless smug jabs at transhumanism are one of the major draws for you), but I would be able to enjoy it as well.</div> </div> </div> </div>I disagree. I think that making humanity the end goal for all Prometheans is a strong thematic choice - strong here meaning &quot;showing great determination&quot;. Other endings would dilute that theme. I don't think you're wrong for your opinion, I just have a different one.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988498#post988498\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I might not be in the target audience, but I think I should have been. The Creature is my absolute all time favorite classic horror monster. Mad scientists are my second favorite. I absolutely loved Frankenstein; and I love stories about artificial life. By most metrics, I am in the target audience. Promethean should have appealed to me. But when I can check of all of those boxes, yet the game still doesn't appeal to me, I can say something is wrong. I mean, I'll I'm asking for is at least something saying &quot;Prometheans can pursue goals other than becoming human&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>Did you read the first page of this thread? Because before this derail, the thread was about explaining to The Shadow Man that Promethean is not a game about playing variations on The Creature. Promethean is an original concept that takes inspiration from many sources, including but not limited to The Creature. Just because you like The Creature does not guarantee that you will like Promethean, just as liking The Cure doesn't guarantee you'll like My Chemical Romance. I'm sorry you feel left out for not being part of Promethean's target audience, but Promethean is not going to change. It made choices and it committed to them, and if you don't like those choices, you probably aren't going to like Promethean. If you want to use it as a base for your own setting hack that's fine but please stop trying to make other people miserable because you don't like the game they like.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":269,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","user":"Charlaquin","date":". 10-16-2016, 07:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T16:51:50-07:00","id":988517,"title":"","content":"While I wouldn't object to a hypothetical supplement that provides alternatives to the New Dawn, neither will I throw a hissy fit it it never happens. The game frankly doesn't need it, so it's in the \u201cthat would be nice\u201d category for me rather than \u201cthat must be done\u201d. And if it does happen, I'm hoping for something along the lines of Great-Grandfather Crow: something different than, but not superior to, human.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T16:55:50-07:00","id":988520,"title":"","content":"I agree with the &quot;not superior&quot; thing. Though I of course disagree regarding whether or not it needs it. <br /> <br /> And I know it isn't meant to be an exact match, but come on. You can understand why it's frustrating that the gameline in my favorite fictional setting that covers my favorite classic monster archetype lets me down. <br /> <br /> And honestly, I feel like the best way to proceed is to finish TLC and then make it my canon. Pretend that things are better. As I've said on the mental health thread, I have at long last realized that lying to myself and others is the only thing that will ever make me happy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T17:02:13-07:00","id":988523,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988520#post988520\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And I know it isn't meant to be an exact match, but come on. You can understand why it's frustrating that the gameline in my favorite fictional setting that covers my favorite classic monster archetype lets me down.</div> </div> </div> </div>I absolutely can, and I'm sorry you feel that way. I can't honestly say I'm not glad it is the way it is, but I can totally empathize with loving Frankenstein and not liking Promethean.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988498#post988498\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And honestly, I feel like the best way to proceed is to finish TLC and then make it my canon. Pretend that things are better. As I've said on the mental health thread, I have at long last realized that lying to myself and others is the only thing that will ever make me happy.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't know about the lying part, but I feel like &quot;hack the game and use that instead of trying to rail against a game who's goals don't line up with your desires&quot; is exactly what people have been advising you to do.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T17:13:02-07:00","id":988528,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988523#post988523\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I absolutely can, and I'm sorry you feel that way. I can't honestly say I'm not glad it is the way it is, but I can totally empathize with loving Frankenstein and not liking Promethean.</div> </div> </div> </div> Yep; nothing wrong with that. But that's different from claiming that there's something wrong with the game. I don't like Vampire or Beast; but I don't claim that there's anything wrong with either of them. They're just not for me.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988523#post988523\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't know about the lying part, but I feel like &quot;hack the game and use that instead of trying to rail against a game who's goals don't line up with your desires&quot; is exactly what people have been advising you to do.</div> </div> </div> </div> Exactly. My long-standing advice to you has been to change your approach from \u201cthis is what's wrong with the game and here's how I'm going to fix it\u201d to \u201cthis is what I don't like about the game and here's what I'm going to do instead.\u201d It's a subtle but profound difference.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":421,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","user":"Dataweaver","date":". 10-17-2016, 10:37 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T17:22:21-07:00","id":988529,"title":"","content":"See, I'm gonna maintain that the things I don't like are genuine flaws. But what I'm talking about is just pretending that it doesn't have those flaws, and pretending that it is how I'd like it to be, because reality isn't an illusion but you can fight it by treating it like it is.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T17:39:43-07:00","id":988533,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988529#post988529\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">See, I'm gonna maintain that the things I don't like are genuine flaws.</div> </div> </div> </div>So, what, your opinion is just better than that of the people who do like it? Those things can genuinely hamper your enjoyment of the game. You can genuinely believe that the game would have broader appeal if those things were changed. But that doesn't make people who's enjoyment they enhance wrong. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988498#post988498\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But what I'm talking about is just pretending that it doesn't have those flaws, and pretending that it is how I'd like it to be, because reality isn't an illusion but you can fight it by treating it like it is.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, the reality being an illusion thing is arguable; the simulation hypothesis suggests that the universe could actually be a hologram, though it's still totally hypothetical. Anyway, on the subject of actually relavent things, you can tell yourself that your hack is canon all you want, but if you engage with other forum users about Promethean under that assumption outside of your homebrew thread you are going to start receiving infractions for it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T17:47:52-07:00","id":988536,"title":"","content":"I've explained my objections and why I consider them to be genuine flaws that should be addressed. <br /> <br /> If the mods want to infract me for it, I can't really stop them, but I can't think of another approach. I've tried everything else, and that includes killing myself. Since that didn't work, I'm kind of stuck here, and I'm trying this as a new way to go forward. I'm primarily trying to lie to myself- I always wanted to be able to do that. If I can convince myself that things are as they should be- the thing that optimists and the religious and spiritual do- I'll be much happier.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T17:56:02-07:00","id":988539,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988536#post988536\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've explained my objections and why I consider them to be genuine flaws that should be addressed.</div> </div> </div> </div>Except what you've explained has entirely been related to your personal tastes (which are personal), and we've established that other people have different personal tastes. Yet, you maintain that your tastes are objectively correct?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988498#post988498\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If the mods want to infract me for it, I can't really stop them, but I can't think of another approach. I've tried everything else, and that includes killing myself. Since that didn't work, I'm kind of stuck here, and I'm trying this as a new way to go forward. I'm primarily trying to lie to myself- I always wanted to be able to do that. If I can convince myself that things are as they should be- the thing that optimists and the religious and spiritual do- I'll be much happier.</div> </div> </div> </div>Lie to yourself as much as you want, but don't mislead other people.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T17:58:38-07:00","id":988540,"title":"","content":"I maintain that if the game was closer to my personal tastes in some ways, it would overall be better. This is not a universal rule. &quot;This would be better if it were closer to Gecko's personal tastes&quot; is not a universal rule for things. It's just that the particular gripes I have with Promethean, and the things I would want to change, are things I genuinely think would improve the game. <br /> <br /> And if other people want to see the Onyx Path version as canon, I can't stop them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T18:21:57-07:00","id":988548,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988483#post988483\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's quite playable. There's a price to going Centimanus (you don't generate Vitriol); but that's to be expected when playing the equivalent of a low-Humanity vampire.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thx. I may give the book a more thorough reading. Altho between university and the vampire the requiem game i'm running right now, it might not be a good time to get ideas for a new game. :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Completed campaign: Scion 2nd Edition. Les L\u00e9gendes Currently playing: Being a dad for a 3 year old daughter and a 2 years old son and now a beautiful new baby.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11312-maitrecorbo","name":"Maitrecorbo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11312_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"719"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T18:31:56-07:00","id":988553,"title":"","content":"See, this is the main reason why I'm looking forward to Crossover Chronicle. ;-)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T20:57:20-07:00","id":988667,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988443#post988443\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Again, the fact that there are all of these intricately detailed and diverse paths isn't worth much if they all have the shame forced end goal.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I mean, I'll I'm asking for is at least something saying &quot;Prometheans can pursue goals other than becoming human&quot;. </div> </div> </div>I'm starting to think you may have some misapprehensions about what actually happens in a Promethean game around the table. I've never been in a game where the Throng sat around bemoaning that they aren't human. In fact actually talking about the Pilgrimage and the New Dawn occupies maybe one percent of play. What do most Prometheans do? They pursue goals that are important to them. They form relationships with people as best they can given their condition, relationships that are all the more valuable and wonderful for how fleeting they inevitably are. They fight monsters. They solve mysteries. They do <i>whatever they want to do.</i><br /> The idea that having humanity be the end goal of the Pilgrimage is limiting to the game just does not hold up at all when you actually get down to <i>playing it.</i><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I might not be in the target audience, but I think I should have been. The Creature is my absolute all time favorite classic horror monster. Mad scientists are my second favorite. I absolutely loved Frankenstein; and I love stories about artificial life. By most metrics, I am in the target audience. Promethean should have appealed to me. But when I can check of all of those boxes, yet the game still doesn't appeal to me, I can say something is wrong. </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> You can understand why it's frustrating that the gameline in my favorite fictional setting that covers my favorite classic monster archetype lets me down. </div> </div> </div>See, that's part of the problem. Liking something, no matter how intensely you like it, does not give you ownership of it.<br /> Frankenstein was the first book my father ever read to me. I've seen every Frankenstein movie. Every single one. I've seen The Protomen in concert four times and Janelle Monae once. It seems to me that we share a lot of the same approach to Promethean, the difference being I think it works wonderfully as an extension of those influences. That doesn't mean I'm objectively correct just because I love all those things though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","name":"Caitiff Primogen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2507_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T03:17:39-07:00","id":988761,"title":"","content":"As I see it there are only two possible end goals for a Promethean: reach the New Dawn and become human or turn to the Centimanus and become a monster. If not for either of those two, then what could a Promethean become?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12085-beriorn","name":"Beriorn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12085_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T03:39:44-07:00","id":988768,"title":"","content":"A crow. A tree, maybe. (These two have tentative support in 1e.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T04:00:10-07:00","id":988775,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988502#post988502\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If the Demon Storyteller's Guide can give us a cyberpunk pocket plane where you play as Stigmatic blade runner cops, then I'd expect a hypothetical Promethean Storyteller's Guide to have alternate New Dawns. That satisfies everybody; Promethean's canonical &quot;integrity&quot; isn't tainted in the eyes of the thematic purists, and everyone looking for alternatives is sated.<br /> <br /> ...fuck, I really want that book now.</div> </div> </div> </div>So much this! I always let Alternative New Dawns, but 'official' mechanics solutions would be great help for it. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> &lt;Cross fingers for <b>Promethean Storyteller's Guide</b> to come as fast as possible&gt;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T04:15:26-07:00","id":988781,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Beriorn</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988761#post988761\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As I see it there are only two possible end goals for a Promethean: reach the New Dawn and become human or turn to the Centimanus and become a monster. If not for either of those two, then what could a Promethean become?</div> </div> </div> </div>There is fan idea on 'Perfected' Prometheans as other New Dawn, when you lower your weaknesses, like Disquiet or Torment, but still is inhuman monster. For mechanical support - it would probably works as Sanctuary Athanor effect permanently on the Created <i>himself</i>.<br /> <br /> Or just peaceful death for the Phosphorus looking ones,","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T05:26:00-07:00","id":988803,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Beriorn</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988761#post988761\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As I see it there are only two possible end goals for a Promethean: reach the New Dawn and become human or turn to the Centimanus and become a monster. If not for either of those two, then what could a Promethean become?</div> </div> </div> </div>Frakensteins could split into multiple individuals.Galatea could refine their disquiet and become able to receive uncorrupted love. Osiris could refine their form into deathly ephemera. Tammuz could refine themselves into living words. Ulgan could refine themselves into shadowy ephemera. Unfleshed could refine their pyros into aether and azoth into primium. Extempore could become anything.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T05:37:29-07:00","id":988806,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988536#post988536\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've explained my objections and why I consider them to be genuine flaws that should be addressed.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200b<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">You've done so to the point that you are generating constant flag reports for threadcrapping and derailing, as well as making attacks against both the game developers and fans of the game. Stop it, now.<br /> You would not be the first person banned from these forums for constant complaining and thread derailing about how a specific game does not meet your needs and desires and I am asking you to not make that ban necessary. I am being as polite but clear about this as I can be.<br /> If you wish to continue the conversation you are having with Charlaquin then take it to PM. There's nothing particularly wrong with that conversation other than it is off topic to this thread and distracting other people from having the discussion this topic is about.</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Onyx Path Forum Administrator</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">Posts in this color are moderator posts</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this color mean a Great Old One has driven me mad.</span></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11-darksider","name":"Darksider","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11_2.jpeg","title":"Forum Administrator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1692"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T06:39:33-07:00","id":988832,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>milo v3</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988803#post988803\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Frakensteins could split into multiple individuals.Galatea could refine their disquiet and become able to receive uncorrupted love. Osiris could refine their form into deathly ephemera. Tammuz could refine themselves into living words. Ulgan could refine themselves into shadowy ephemera. Unfleshed could refine their pyros into aether and azoth into primium. Extempore could become anything.</div> </div> </div> </div>You know, that could actually work. The Pilgrimage is quite personal as is, and every Promethean will have its own idea of the goals it wants to achieve aside from getting all Pinocchio up in this mess.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12085-beriorn","name":"Beriorn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12085_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T08:18:51-07:00","id":988865,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988433#post988433\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Cryptozoologists have tried for years to find the line between criticism and opinion. Objectivity is a unicorn.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, I'm a virgin, so presumably that means objectivity accrues to me. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> And I think Promethean is great.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988515#post988515\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think that making humanity the end goal for all Prometheans is a strong thematic choice - strong here meaning &quot;showing great determination&quot;. Other endings would dilute that theme. I don't think you're wrong for your opinion, I just have a different one.</div> </div> </div> </div>To bring it back to the OP a bit, I think there's a disconnection between people who focus on the end goal of the Pilgrimmage, and the journey of getting there - or more fundamentally, those who think the game focusses on &quot;<i>What</i> are you?&quot; (Promethean, then human) and those who think it focusses on &quot;<i>Who</i> are you?&quot; (an vast territory of possibilities). I'm in the latter camp, in that In interpret the game as about who the Promethean wants to be, compared to who they already are - which is why I like a defined answer to what Prometheans become, so the light is shone firmly on the latter question, as revealed by the route taken along the Pilgrimmage.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>milo v3</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988803#post988803\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Frakensteins could split into multiple individuals.Galatea could refine their disquiet and become able to receive uncorrupted love. Osiris could refine their form into deathly ephemera. Tammuz could refine themselves into living words. Ulgan could refine themselves into shadowy ephemera. Unfleshed could refine their pyros into aether and azoth into primium. Extempore could become anything.</div> </div> </div> </div>That said, I wouldn't <i>object</i> to a supplement with ideas for different New Dawns, especially ones as interesting as these.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T10:14:33-07:00","id":988909,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Maitrecorbo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988474#post988474\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm curious about something. Keep in my i've only skimmed the book so far. But how possible is it to play a centimanus? I could see a prometheans character disgusted with humanity and deciding to become a crime boss or hit man or enforcer. Could you still play your character in the transmutation of flux i think its called?? I see it like wanting to play a low humanity vampire. Maybe not part of the majority but definitaly doable.</div> </div> </div> </div>A couple things. First, while it is possible to play a Centimanus, it is unsustainable. Flux will eventually eat you alive. This isn't a reason not to do it, but it is a consideration. Myself, I've loved playing characters on a tragic downward spiral. Also, the thing to remember about Centimanus is that they can always return to the Pilgrimage. Any Promethean can shift to Lead, which can lead to a really interesting redemption arc. Second, there is nothing to say a Promethean wants to be a nice human. The dark sides of humanity like crime, war, and such are parts of humanity. It is entirely possible to play the sort of character you describe and still be on the Pilgrimage. Plenty of the Roles either explicitly or potentially delve into sin, weakness, or evil. In fact, I'd argue that doing it this way fits the character better than becoming Centimanus. It is hard to be a crime boss when you've abandoned rationality, civilization, and even the humanoid form to the chaos of Flux.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Eric Christian Berg</b><br /> <i>Onyx Path Freelancer</i><br /> Promethean: The Created Second Edition, Dark Eras Companion","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2019-eberg","name":"eberg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2019_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"284"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T10:28:55-07:00","id":988919,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Maitrecorbo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988474#post988474\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm curious about something. Keep in my i've only skimmed the book so far. But how possible is it to play a centimanus? I could see a prometheans character disgusted with humanity and deciding to become a crime boss or hit man or enforcer. Could you still play your character in the transmutation of flux i think its called?? I see it like wanting to play a low humanity vampire. Maybe not part of the majority but definitaly doable.</div> </div> </div> </div>To add to what Eric said, look at it this way. There are a few different Refinements that could work for playing a character who's a crime boss or assassin in a way that one would play a low-Humanity vampire. A Centimanus, though, isn't like a low-Humanity vampire. It's more like playing a particularly coherent draugr. (Or at best, a cWoD Masquerade vampire on one of the Path of Metamorphosis or something equally nasty)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Christopher Shaffer, freelancer. Game line contributions: W20, Night Horrors, TC: \u00c6on, Scion (details <a href=\"http://mythicfoxwrites.blogspot.com/2019/07/stuff-ive-worked-on.html\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>) <br /> <a href=\"http://mythicfoxwrites.blogspot.com/2020/10/actual-play-index.html\" target=\"_blank\"> <b>Blog post write-ups of my gaming sessions; Currently running Exalted, and also updating old Promethean sessions</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/171-mythicfox","name":"MythicFox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar171_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"151"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T10:41:34-07:00","id":988923,"title":"","content":"Yeah, the question you need to ask is what concept you want for the character. Playing a Centimanus is perfectly doable no matter what version you're playing, but first you have to consider what about the concept relates to that. A good way to work it out is to consider your character's goals. What do they want? Do they just want money/power? Are they working towards a Pilgrimage, and if so how do they see it and what goal do they envision at the end? For example, if your character is part of a criminal organization, what's their relationship with it? Do they see it as a means to end or a surrogate family? If it's the latter, I could see a Promethean wanting to become human so that they could truly be a part of it, and not just ultimately a tool that the organization uses. <br /> <br /> However, I don't think Centimani are that difficult to play- if the only option for Prometheans who didn't want to become human was so unstable and unsympathetic it was comparable to a draugr, then you'd have to either change it or open up the Refinements.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5358,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","user":"Geckopirateship","date":". 10-17-2016, 01:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T10:51:35-07:00","id":988930,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Maitrecorbo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988474#post988474\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm curious about something. Keep in my i've only skimmed the book so far. But how possible is it to play a centimanus? I could see a prometheans character disgusted with humanity and deciding to become a crime boss or hit man or enforcer. Could you still play your character in the transmutation of flux i think its called?? I see it like wanting to play a low humanity vampire. Maybe not part of the majority but definitaly doable.</div> </div> </div> </div>To add further to what MythicFox said, I think if you're looking for a Refinement that is conducive to playing a hit man, crime boss, or mob enforcer, that your best bets would be Stannum, Ferrum, or Cobalus. Any of those would actually probably work much better than Centimanus.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2507,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","user":"Caitiff Primogen","date":". 10-17-2016, 01:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","name":"Caitiff Primogen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2507_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T12:02:53-07:00","id":988964,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caitiff Primogen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988930#post988930\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To add further to what MythicFox said, I think if you're looking for a Refinement that is conducive to playing a hit man, crime boss, or mob enforcer, that your best bets would be Stannum, Ferrum, or Cobalus. Any of those would actually probably work much better than Centimanus.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yeah i reread the transmutation part in the book and i agree. sorry my example were bad <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Completed campaign: Scion 2nd Edition. Les L\u00e9gendes Currently playing: Being a dad for a 3 year old daughter and a 2 years old son and now a beautiful new baby.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11312-maitrecorbo","name":"Maitrecorbo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11312_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"719"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T12:19:57-07:00","id":988974,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Maitrecorbo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988964#post988964\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Yeah i reread the transmutation part in the book and i agree. sorry my example were bad <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>They weren't, really. Its a pretty common misconception that in order to be less than sanguine about humanity as a whole you have to be Centimanus. Honestly just about any Refinement that isn't Aurum can be spun in such a way that a Promethean following it takes a dim view of mankind, and to be honest even an Aurum could have such a disposition and choose to emulate what they feel humanity &quot;should&quot; be rather than what it is.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","name":"Caitiff Primogen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2507_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T12:42:41-07:00","id":988981,"title":"","content":"I think that misconception is a holdover from first edition, where Prometheans had to keep track of Humanity as a literal score measuring how 'good' of a person you were by human standards.<br /> <br /> If there's anything I continually praise the 2E books for in general, it's the heavy conceptual reworking of that mechanic as a whole.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Christopher Shaffer, freelancer. Game line contributions: W20, Night Horrors, TC: \u00c6on, Scion (details <a href=\"http://mythicfoxwrites.blogspot.com/2019/07/stuff-ive-worked-on.html\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>) <br /> <a href=\"http://mythicfoxwrites.blogspot.com/2020/10/actual-play-index.html\" target=\"_blank\"> <b>Blog post write-ups of my gaming sessions; Currently running Exalted, and also updating old Promethean sessions</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/171-mythicfox","name":"MythicFox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar171_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"151"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T12:49:10-07:00","id":988984,"title":"","content":"Yeah, the upside of the new Pilgrimage stat is it's fairly easy to use it to represent any kind of journey/transformation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5358,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","user":"Geckopirateship","date":". 10-17-2016, 03:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T13:30:45-07:00","id":988997,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988984#post988984\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah, the upside of the new Pilgrimage stat is it's fairly easy to use it to represent any kind of journey/transformation.</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:red\">Remember what you've been told about bringing your homebrew outside of the thread for it. Last warning.</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T13:41:21-07:00","id":989003,"title":"","content":"I was just making a general statement regarding the flexibility of the stat, since people were already praising it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T16:19:06-07:00","id":989064,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caitiff Primogen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=988974#post988974\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They weren't, really. Its a pretty common misconception that in order to be less than sanguine about humanity as a whole you have to be Centimanus. Honestly just about any Refinement that isn't Aurum can be spun in such a way that a Promethean following it takes a dim view of mankind, and to be honest even an Aurum could have such a disposition and choose to emulate what they feel humanity &quot;should&quot; be rather than what it is.</div> </div> </div> </div>Aurum doesn't require you to romanticize humanity. In fact, such a thing is likely to be an impediment. The Roles in Aurum are uniquely suited to being involved in organized crime as they require you to be in human relationships. Running a mob would fulfill the Leader Role, being a member of a gang would be a Companion Role, and working for a crime boss would fit the Follower Role. Aurum is a &quot;get your hands dirty&quot; Refinement. You don't just watch humanity, you need to get in there and experience it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Eric Christian Berg</b><br /> <i>Onyx Path Freelancer</i><br /> Promethean: The Created Second Edition, Dark Eras Companion","edited":{"userid":2019,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2019-eberg","user":"eberg","date":". 10-18-2016, 11:00 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2019-eberg","name":"eberg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2019_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"284"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-18T09:13:55-07:00","id":989382,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>eberg</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987958-prometheans-are-what-exactly?p=989064#post989064\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Aurum doesn't require you to romanticize humanity. In fact, such a thing is likely to be an impediment. The Roles in Aurum are uniquely suited to being involved in organized crime as they require you to be in human relationships. Running a mob would fulfill the Leader Role, being a member of a gang would be a Companion Role, and working for a crime boss would fit the Follower Role. Aurum is a &quot;get your hands dirty&quot; Refinement. You don't just watch humanity, you need to get in there and experience it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Proving this point, a player in my current game got his &quot;Leader&quot; role by killing the head of his cult and taking it's place. The cult sacrifices humans on a monthly basis. He's not intending to stop this practice","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Glorious Useless-Post Prana<br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Cost: 2</span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">m; </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mins: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Linguistics 1, Essence 1 </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Type: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Simple</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Keywords: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mute</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Duration: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Instant</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Prerequisite Charms: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Ten-Characters Methodology</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2589-magnum-opus","name":"Magnum Opus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2589_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"821"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}